<h2 class="mb-4">Vision &amp; Mission</h2>

<!-- Vision -->
<div class="mb-5">
    <h5 class="fw-semibold mb-2 text-primary">Our Vision</h5>
    <p class="mb-0 ps-3 border-start border-3 border-primary">
        To be a dynamic and inclusive knowledge gateway that
        <em>bridges heritage and innovation</em>,
        empowering every resident of Gampola to learn, create, and thrive.
    </p>
</div>

<!-- Mission -->
<div>
    <h5 class="fw-semibold mb-3 text-primary">Our Mission</h5>
    <ul class="ps-4 lh-lg">
        <li>Provide equitable access to authoritative information in print and digital formats.</li>
        <li>Promote lifelong reading and learning through inspiring programmes and partnerships.</li>
        <li>Preserve the cultural memory of the Central Province for future generations.</li>
        <li>Leverage technology to narrow the digital divide and support e-government initiatives.</li>
    </ul>
</div>


